{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Shall I break.</b> From the same root as במשבר בנים (Hosea 13:13). The sense: is it possible that I have the power to do such things, as though I would bring the woman in labor to the birth and be unable to deliver, or I who gave birth to the entire world — and then held back?"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 66, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:01:11.278565632Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}